  "note": "Each policy is a frozen way of choosing which plans to start, or when to close them, run beside the live rule on the same nights and scored by the same closure rules. Nothing here has ever changed a live plan. Records start empty and fill one night at a time \u2014 there is no backfill, so a small count means young, not weak. shadow record \u2014 the live policy changes only by operator ratification.",
